WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.689
The Zhongzhiyuan AI Innovation Acceleration Area covers a provisional rough boundary of about 1.

00:00:14.689 --> 00:00:29.378
929 million square meters, derived directly from the announcement text extents rather than from any official redline survey.

00:00:29.378 --> 00:00:44.067
Within this boundary, anyone can complete the full ordinary path without ever registering, scanning a code, or using any AI system at all — ground-level bus routes, underground pedestrian passages, neighborhood retail corridors, and the community clinic all remain operational on their own.

00:00:44.067 --> 00:01:05.100
AI self-service kiosks, AI translation stands, and AI wayfinding are introduced only as voluntary, scope-bounded, and stoppable side layers, deliberately separated from the ordinary path so that when they stop serving, the public immediately returns to ordinary state without any recovery wait. The recovery state does not constitute any form of authorization, approval, or G1 maturity; the actual implementation timeline depends entirely on the official boundary being published and a full recalculation being performed against that official geometry.

